# Incremental deploy (team-lead)

- Do not publish `admin/` without Admin Playwright green — no exceptions.
- Admin app features must already be on admin web with Playwright before `admin/` export/publish.
- Keep links valid (`check-links.py`); prefer additive page changes.
- Release coordination → **team-lead** GO/NO-GO with proof.
